[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_9999","text":"工作人员A"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0010","text":"辛苦啦——！送慰问品来啦——！\n豆沙包三个，肉包两个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0020","text":"好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0030","text":"…………咦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0040","text":"好好好，没问题\n三峰也是肉包……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0050","text":"——不好意思，\n肉包三个，豆沙包两个，拜托了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0060","text":"好的，那我就在大家回来之前送过来！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0070","text":"豆沙包三个……肉包两个……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0080","text":"呼……呼……\n为什么……会变成这样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0090","text":"『我……明明想要肉包的……』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0100","text":"『三峰刚才在犹豫，正好！\n　豆沙包我就不客气啦——！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0110","text":"哈……哈…………\n…………我的……才不会给你呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0120","text":"哎呀，田中小姐？您怎么了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0130","text":"——那个，不好意思，刚才的中式包子……\n豆沙包和肉包，能不能……帮我换一个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0140","text":"哈——！麻美美，我回来啦——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0150","text":"摩美美酱……是不是……有点热……？\n额头上……有汗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0160","text":"啊，没什么……\n…………真的没什么啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0170","text":"“在梦幻的发丝间”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0180","text":"“洒下如魔法般的、恋爱的芬芳”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0190","text":"恋爱的时候，是不会流汗的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_02030000_04_0200","text":"“Magia·L'Antica”"}]
